      "UsesAmmoSameLocationOnly"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Ultralight 'Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The third Great House to develop an ultralight BattleMech, after House Davion and House Kurita, House Liao created the Slowpoke in response to the appearance of the Federated Suns' Junior in the twenty-fifth century. An altogether unimpressive design due to poor planning and implementation of its conception and manufacture, the Slowpoke never reached any greater success and was often relegated to secondary duties.",
